{"id":"e88b5b361423eb7a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-npspace.md","title":"Nondeterministic Polynomial Space","display":"df-npspace — Nondeterministic Polynomial Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-npspace","aliases":["28-df-npspace","NPSPACE"],"display":"df-npspace — Nondeterministic Polynomial Space","depends_on":["[[28-df-nspace]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-npspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-npspace</span><span>NPSPACE</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-npspace — Nondeterministic Polynomial Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{NSPACE}(t)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a> 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPSPACE}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NPSPACE}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+2)^a\">\\((n+2)^a\\)</span> 统一处理空串与短输入；在容许常数因子的复杂度约定下与通常的多项式并类一致。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义4.5；印刷81页；PDF107页。对应并类陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE}(t)$ 是 [[28-df-nspace]] 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；$a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPSPACE}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).","display":true},{"tex":"(n+2)^a","display":false}],"bytes":808,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基本复杂性类：[[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]、[[28-df-l]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-pspace]]、[[28-df-npspace]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-nexp]]。"},{"id":"dc66c114284dcdc1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["54da139362531e67"]}